OL,3,AMichael Sheen says he was snubbed by
OL,4,Afirst minister over toxic pollution
OL,5,Aclaims
OL,6,
OL,7,FMichael Sheen says an offer to meet
OL,8,FWales' first minister over claims
OL,9,Fpeople have been poisoned by decades of
OL,10,Fexposure to toxic waste dumps "was not
OL,11,Ftaken up".
OL,13,FThe Welsh actor contacted Rhun ap
OL,14,FIorwerth ahead of a BBC documentary
OL,15,Fwhich looked into claims of widespread
OL,16,Fchemical contamination in Wales.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
